{"id":"n86888-1-7","stage":4,"title":"현직 · 现职","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86888-1-7-1","ko":"지금 하고 있는 일은 그만두실 건가요?","zh":"您打算停止现在正在做的工作吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일은","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그만두실","meaning":"停住，停","explanation":"그만두다：停住，停；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건가요?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"停住，停","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"停住正在做的事，不再进行。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/25fe95c47eb672323318.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86888-1-7-2","ko":"글쎄요, 아직까지 저는 현직을 떠날 생각이 없어요.","zh":"嗯，目前我还没有离开现职的打算。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄요,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄요：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60633","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직까지","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"현직을","meaning":"现职，现任","explanation":"현직：现职，现任；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"현직","audio":"/audio/3751e4aec07d4136de64.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86888","senseId":"1","lemma":"현직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떠날","meaning":"离开，离去","explanation":"떠나다：离开，离去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"떠나다","audio":"/audio/9ee56e8783da00e3fbed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53746","senseId":"2","lemma":"떠나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각이","meaning":"想，决定","explanation":"생각：想，决定；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"4","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b6013caa74979f40","term":"글쎄요","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3","entryId":"60633","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄요"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"3751e4aec07d4136","term":"현직","zh":"现职，现任","audio":"/audio/3751e4aec07d4136de64.mp3","entryId":"86888","definition":"现在的职业；或指在该职业中负责的事。","pronunciation":["현ː직"]},{"id":"9ee56e8783da00e3","term":"떠나다","zh":"离开，离去","audio":"/audio/9ee56e8783da00e3fbed.mp3","entryId":"53746","definition":"为了到别的地方，脱离所在地。","pronunciation":["떠나다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想，决定","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"在心里决意要做某事；或指想做某事的那种决心。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c70fbd949bcd0c3eda9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.925,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86888","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":141,"sequenceScore":2.7517,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您打算停止现在正在做的工作吗？","嗯，目前我还没有离开现职的打算。","这条街上的店铺，商品价格真的非常便宜啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您打算停止现在正在做的工作吗？","嗯，目前我还没有离开现职的打算。","这条街上的店铺，商品价格真的非常便宜啊？"],"answer":1}]}
